title: 'The Spectrum of a Compact Internal Space III: Finite-Window Dynamics of Cosmic Structure
  Formation'
type: article
authors:
- family-names: Guo
  given-names: Jinku
  orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0000-6600-6171
